        "texto": "Nisroch was an idol of Nineveh, concerning which there have been various conjectures. The rabbins affirmed that it was made out of one of the planks of Noah’s ark. Others supposed it to be an image of the dove which Noah sent out from the ark. Some have thought the planet Saturn…"
